# Bock Media deploy & smoke

Production host: `plex@192.168.1.187`, systemd unit `ourmedia`, data dir `~/.bockmedia`.

## Web + server

```bash
scp server.py plex@192.168.1.187:/home/plex/Documents/github/ourMedia/server.py
./scripts/deploy_web.sh
```

`deploy_web.sh` rsyncs all of `public/` and restarts `ourmedia`. When editing JS/CSS, bump cache-bust query params in `public/index.html` **and** update matching paths in `public/sw.js` (increment `CACHE` name when shell assets change).

## Android debug to phone

```bash
cd android && ./gradlew assembleDebug
adb -s <serial> install -r app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk
```

Device smoke: `ANDROID_SERIAL=<serial> ./scripts/android-device-smoke.sh`

## Release APK to /app page

Requires matching versions in `android/app/build.gradle.kts` and `app-release-notes.json`:

```bash
./scripts/deploy_mobile_app.sh
```

## Post-deploy checks

- `curl -s http://192.168.1.187:3001/api/health` — watchdog fresh, LAN security flags
- Web hard refresh — Dashboard Service Health, Home tiles
- Force-quit mobile app after server changes that affect home feed or auth
